{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker"]]},"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Instance Property","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"RejectionReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"externalID":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV16rejectionReportsScSyAA15RejectionReportVGvp","role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Trackers"}],"symbolKind":"property","title":"rejectionReports","remoteSource":{"url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Trackers\/Tracker.swift#L214","fileName":"Tracker.swift"}},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"text":"RejectionReport","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/RejectionReport","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV"},{"text":"> { ","kind":"text"},{"text":"get","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" }","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The tracker’s worker checks each event’s ","type":"text"},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"constraintViolation()"},{"text":" before anything else, so a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"rejected event is never enriched, held by a consent, written to a store or delivered. A","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"record a store recovered is checked too, and one rejected is forgotten by the store. In","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"debug builds each rejection is also logged at error level.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Reports wait until they are read, merged: a rejection joins the waiting report of the same"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"event, property and keyword, adding to its count and widening its timestamps. So the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"reports waiting unread are at most one per constraint the app declares, however many events"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"break them. Copies of a tracker share one sequence, which has one consumer and ends once the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"tracker has finished. A "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" tracker’s is empty."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/rejectionreports"]}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on it, in the order the rejections happen."}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"references":{"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"What app code tracks events with: it records each event, with the time, the caller’s source"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"location and the task’s context, as one of its "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"topic","kind":"symbol","title":"Tracker","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}],"navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"Tracker"}]},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers":{"role":"collection","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"type":"topic","title":"Trackers","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers","url":"\/documentation\/trackers"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/rejectionReports":{"title":"rejectionReports","role":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A report of each event the tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"on it, in the order the rejections happen."}],"fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"rejectionReports","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:ScS","text":"AsyncStream","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":"<","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers15RejectionReportV","text":"RejectionReport","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":">","kind":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/rejectionreports","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/rejectionReports"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/RejectionReport":{"role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"RejectionReport"}],"abstract":[{"text":"Events a tracker rejected because a property broke a constraint declared on it: the event’s","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"name, the property and the keyword it broke, how many were rejected and when they were tracked.","type":"text"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/RejectionReport","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/rejectionreport","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"RejectionReport"}],"title":"RejectionReport"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/noOp":{"kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"noOp","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A tracker that drops every event, logging each one at debug level. Its "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property"},{"type":"text","text":" are"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"empty."}],"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"noOp","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","text":"Tracker","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/noOp","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/noop"},"doc://Trackers/documentation/Trackers/Tracker/records-swift.property":{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The records of the events this tracker tracks, for a delivery to read."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"var"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"records"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Tracker"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:8Trackers7TrackerV7RecordsV","kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Records"}],"role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/trackers\/tracker\/records-swift.property","identifier":"doc:\/\/Trackers\/documentation\/Trackers\/Tracker\/records-swift.property","type":"topic","title":"records"}}}